189	    /// Given completed events `[START, FINISH]` and its corresponding
190	    /// `CompletedMarker(pos: 0, _)`.
191	    /// Append a new `START` events as `[START, FINISH, NEWSTART]`,
192	    /// then mark `NEWSTART` as `START`'s parent with saving its relative
193	    /// distance to `NEWSTART` into forward_parent(=2 in this case);
